4. draw-diagram (skills/external/draw-diagram/)

   Original work of the ai-engine project, including all six engine layers
   (d3js / drawio / echarts / excalidraw / mermaid / plantuml). No
   third-party diagram library is vendored: the self-hosted render servers
   install their npm dependencies at run time, and the other engines are
   reached through a rendering service or a CDN script tag.

   Some reference pages render an engine's official documentation in
   Chinese and carry the source URL plus a capture date. The upstream
   project's own licence terms apply to that source material: d3 (ISC),
   Apache ECharts (Apache-2.0), drawio (Apache-2.0), Excalidraw (MIT),
   Mermaid (MIT). PlantUML is reached through a PlantUML server or a
   user-installed local toolchain; see the upstream project for its terms.

